{{Status Effect 2
|Status Effect Name=Defense Down
|Status Effect Icon=
|Element={{wind}}
|Buff or Debuff=Debuff
|Removable=Yes
|Effect=Reduces a target's [[Defense]].
|Notes=<onlyinclude>
*[[Defense Down]] effects do not stack with each other. 
**[[Dia]], [[Box Step]], [[Defense Down]], and [[Geo-Frailty]] all stack together additively to a minimum of 1 defense.
***Defense = Base_Defense * (1 - (Dia + Box Step + Defense Down + Frailty)) >= 1
**[[Defense Down]] effects such as [[Acid Bolt]]s, [[Angon (Ability)|Angon]], [[Spirit Surge]]d Jumps, Weaponskill effects, Blue Magic effects, etc do not stack. Only one may be active at a time.
***Stronger effects sometimes overwrite weaker ones, such as the case with [[Angon (Ability)|Angon]]
***Stronger [[Defense Bonus]] effects such as [[Cocoon]] tend to have a higher priority than and either prevent or overwrite [[Defense Down]] effects, but not always.
*The job abilities [[Angon (Ability)|Angon]] and [[Spirit Surge]]d [[Jump]] are not resisted by any known monsters.
**The Defense Down effect will not be applied if [[Jump]] misses. Spirit Surge increases Jump accuracy by a fixed amount, but does not guarantee a hit.
**Spirit Surged Jump overwrites and prevents application of Angon.</onlyinclude>
|Removal Medicine={{ItemIcon|Panacea|16}} [[Panacea]], {{ItemIcon|Vicar's Drink|16}} [[Vicar's Drink]], {{ItemIcon|Cleric's Drink|16}} [[Cleric's Drink]], {{ItemIcon|Catholicon|16}} [[Catholicon]]
